<title>SWEDEN: TABLE-Average yield 6.40 pct Sweden bond auction.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Average yield 6.40 pct Sweden bond auction.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average yield on an auction of two billion crowns worth of 10-year Swedish bonds was 6.40 percent, the Swedish National Debt Office said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>						Bond no 1037</p>
<p>   Volume issued (bln SKR)	    1.998</p>
<p>   Total bids (bln SKR)		 5.467</p>
<p>   Number of accepted bids		 23</p>
<p>   Number of bids			    64</p>
<p>   Lowest rate (pct)		    6.385</p>
<p>   Highest accepted rate		6.400</p>
<p>   Weighted average rate		6.396</p>
<p>   Pct served highest rate	   68.57</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
